[ar:SCARECROW]
[ti:Fire Is Dead]
[by:netease]
[00:00.00]作词 : SCARECROW
[00:00.95]作曲 : SCARECROW
[00:01.90]Fire Is Dead
[00:01.90]灰烬余声
[00:07.45]Throat is tight.
[00:07.45]喉咙发紧
[00:09.71]Biting my tongue till I taste the rust.
[00:09.71]咬着舌头，直到尝到铁锈的腥气
[00:17.46]Staring at the empty nail on the yellow wall.
[00:17.46]盯着发黄的墙上那枚空落的钉子
[00:23.18]The heavy brown coat is gone,
[00:23.18]厚重的棕色大衣已不在
[00:26.70]just a shadow in the dust.
[00:26.70]只剩尘埃里一抹虚影
[00:28.66]Swallowing the bitter water down,
[00:28.66]咽下苦涩的水
[00:31.23]looking at the silent town.
[00:31.23]望着寂静的城
[00:34.51]Striking the wooden match,
[00:34.51]划亮一根火柴
[00:37.20]watching the yellow paper burn to black.
[00:37.20]看着黄纸烧成灰烬
[00:39.85]Striking the wooden match,
[00:39.85]再划一根火柴
[00:42.34]watching the yellow paper burn to black.
[00:42.34]看着黄纸烧尽成灰
[00:44.53]No turning back.
[00:44.53]回不去了
[00:45.98]No turning back.
[00:45.98]再也回不去了
[00:49.71]The heavy door shuts like thunder in my head.
[00:49.71]沉重的门狠狠关上，像雷声在脑中炸响
[00:54.80]Choking on the bitter words that I never said.
[00:54.80]没说出口的话，堵在胸口发酸
[00:58.91]Sweeping up the cold grey ash from the iron pan,
[00:58.91]扫掉铁盘里冰冷的灰
[01:02.12]trying to hold the running water in a shaking hand.
[01:02.12]颤抖的手，妄想抓住流走的水
[01:05.09]The fire is dead.
[01:05.09]火灭了
[01:07.59]The fire is dead.
[01:07.59]火已经灭了
[01:20.48]Footsteps fading down the wooden stair,
[01:20.48]脚步声消失在木质楼梯的尽头
[01:23.24]grasping at the empty winter air.
[01:23.24]伸手攥住空茫的冬意
[01:25.74]A pocket full of salt,
[01:25.74]一口袋盐
[01:27.18]a mouthful of sand.
[01:27.18]一嘴的沙
[01:28.52]Drawing a map for a forgotten land.
[01:28.52]为一片早已忘掉之地画着不存在的地图
[01:31.28]Iron nail tearing at my skin,
[01:31.28]铁钉嵌进我的皮肤
[01:36.13]losing the game before I begin.
[01:36.13]未及开始，便已认输
[01:42.35]Striking the wooden match,
[01:42.35]划亮一根火柴
[01:45.06]watching the yellow paper burn to black.
[01:45.06]看着黄纸烧成灰烬
[01:48.04]Striking the wooden match,
[01:48.04]再划一根火柴
[01:50.32]watching the yellow paper burn to black.
[01:50.32]看着黄纸烧尽成灰
[01:52.52]No turning back.
[01:52.52]再也回不去了
[01:54.00]No turning back.
[01:54.00]真的回不去了
[01:57.76]The heavy door shuts like thunder in my head.
[01:57.76]沉重的门狠狠关上，像雷声炸在脑海
[02:03.20]Choking on the bitter words that I never said.
[02:03.20]没说出口的话，堵在胸口发酸
[02:07.28]Sweeping up the cold grey ash from the iron pan,
[02:07.28]扫掉铁盘里冰冷的灰
[02:10.26]trying to hold the running water in a shaking hand.
[02:10.26]不安的手，妄想抓住流走的水
[02:13.00]The fire is dead.
[02:13.00]火已经灭了
[02:15.72]The fire is dead.
[02:15.72]火真的灭了
[02:19.29]Ash on the floor,
[02:19.29]灰撒在地上
[02:21.99]lock on the door.
[02:21.99]锁落在门上
[02:24.19]Tongue tied tight,
[02:24.19]话堵在嘴里
[02:27.47]end of the light.
[02:27.47]光也到尽头
[02:29.43]The fire is dead.
[02:29.43]是灰烬的余声
[02:34.37]Never said.
[02:34.37]始终未说
[02:37.36]Never said.
[02:37.36]终究没说
